        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Data Types - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int angka = 1000;\n        double desimal = 19.99;\n        char grade = 'A';\n        System.out.println(\"Nilai: \" + angka + \", Desimal: \" + desimal + \", Grade: \" + grade);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Nilai: 1000, Desimal: 19.99, Grade: A</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Data Types</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
