      "java_type_casting": {
        "title": "Java Type Casting",
        "summary": "Konversi tipe data: Widening Casting otomatis (int ke double) dan Narrowing Casting manual `(tipe) variabel`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Konversi tipe data: Widening Casting otomatis (int ke double) dan Narrowing Casting manual `(tipe) variabel`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Type Casting:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Type Casting",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Type Casting - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        double d = 9.78;\n        int i = (int) d; // Narrowing casting manual\n        System.out.println(\"Double: \" + d + \" -> Int: \" + i);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Double: 9.78 -> Int: 9</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Type Casting</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_operators": {
        "title": "Java Operators",
        "summary": "Operator aritmetika (+, -, *, /, %), penugasan (=, +=), pembanding (==, !=, <, >), dan logika (&&, ||, !).",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Operator aritmetika (+, -, *, /, %), penugasan (=, +=), pembanding (==, !=, <, >), dan logika (&&, ||, !).</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Operators:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Operators",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Operators - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int x = 20, y = 6;\n        System.out.println(\"Modulo Sisa Bagi: \" + (x % y));\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Modulo Sisa Bagi: 2</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Operators</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_strings": {
        "title": "Java Strings",
        "summary": "Objek String: manipulasi teks dengan method `length()`, `toUpperCase()`, `indexOf()`, konkatenasi `+`, dan `concat()`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Objek String: manipulasi teks dengan method `length()`, `toUpperCase()`, `indexOf()`, konkatenasi `+`, dan `concat()`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Strings:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Strings",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Strings - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        String txt = \"Skillance Academy\";\n        System.out.println(\"Panjang: \" + txt.length(