      "java_conditions": {
        "title": "Java If...Else",
        "summary": "Percabangan logika keputusan menggunakan struktur `if`, `else if`, `else`, dan operator ternary `(kondisi) ? true : false`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Percabangan logika keputusan menggunakan struktur `if`, `else if`, `else`, dan operator ternary `(kondisi) ? true : false`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java If...Else:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java If...Else",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java If...Else - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int nilai = 85;\n        if (nilai >= 80) {\n            System.out.println(\"Predikat: A (Lulus Istimewa)\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Predikat: A (Lulus Istimewa)</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java If...Else</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_switch": {
        "title": "Java Switch",
        "summary": "Pernyataan pemilihan multi-kasus dengan `switch`, `case`, `break`, `default`, dan sintaks modern Switch Expressions Java 14+ (`->`).",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Pernyataan pemilihan multi-kasus dengan `switch`, `case`, `break`, `default`, dan sintaks modern Switch Expressions Java 14+ (`->`).</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Switch:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Switch",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Switch - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int hari = 3;\n        switch (hari) {\n            case 3 -> System.out.println(\"Hari: Rabu\");\n            default -> System.out.println(\"Hari Lain\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Hari: Rabu</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Switch</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_while_loop": {
        "title": "Java While Loop",
        "summary": "Perulangan `while` yang memeriksa kondisi di awal, dan `do...while` yang menjamin blok kode dieksekusi minimal satu kali.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Perulangan `while` yang memeriksa kondisi di awal, dan `do...while` yang menjamin blok kode dieksekusi minimal satu kali.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java While Loop:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java While Loop",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java While Loop - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int i = 1;\n        while (i <= 3) {\n            System.out.println(\"Iterasi ke-\" + i);\n            i++;\n        }\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Iterasi ke-1\nIterasi ke-2\nIterasi ke-3</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java While Loop</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_for_loop": {
        "title": "Java For Loop",
        "summary": "Perulangan `for` terhitung (inisialisasi; kondisi; step) dan perulangan `for-each` untuk iterasi elemen array.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Perulangan `for` terhitung (inisialisasi; kondisi; step) dan perulangan `for-each` untuk iterasi elemen array.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java For Loop:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java For Loop",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java For Loop - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {\n            System.out.print(i + \" \");\n        }\n        System.out.println();\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">1 2 3 </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java For Loop</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_break": {
        "title": "Java Break/Continue",
        "summary": "Menghentikan perulangan lebih awal dengan `break` dan melompati iterasi saat ini ke langkah berikutnya dengan `continue`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Menghentikan perulangan lebih awal dengan `break` dan melompati iterasi saat ini ke langkah berikutnya dengan `continue`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Break/Continue:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Break/Continue",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Break/Continue - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {\n            if (i == 3) continue;\n            System.out.print(i + \" \");\n        }\n        System.out.println();\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">1 2 4 5 </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Break/Continue</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_arrays": {
        "title": "Java Arrays",
        "summary": "Koleksi data homogen berukuran tetap: deklarasi `tipe[] nama = new tipe[size]`, indeks array berbasis-nol, dan properti `length`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Koleksi data homogen berukuran tetap: deklarasi `tipe[] nama = new tipe[size]`, indeks array berbasis-nol, dan properti `length`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Arrays:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Arrays",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Arrays - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        String[] mobil = {\"Avanza\", \"Innova\", \"Pajero\"};\n        System.out.println(\"Mobil Pertama: \" + mobil[0] + \" | Total: \" + mobil.length);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Mobil Pertama: Avanza | Total: 3</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Arrays</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      }
    },
    "Java Methods": {
      "java_methods": {
        "title": "Java Methods",
        "summary": "Mendefinisikan blok fungsi kode yang dapat digunakan kembali (reusable) di dalam class Java.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Mendefinisikan blok fungsi kode yang dapat digunakan kembali (reusable) di dalam class Java.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Methods:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Methods",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Methods - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    static void sapa() {\n        System.out.println(\"Halo dari Method Java!\");\n    }\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        sapa();\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Halo dari Method Java!</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Methods</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_challenges_methods": {
        "title": "Java Method Challenge",
        "summary": "Latihan dan tantangan logika pemecahan masalah membuat method perhitungan.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Latihan dan tantangan logika pemecahan masalah membuat method perhitungan.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Method Challenge:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Method Challenge",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Method Challenge - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    static int kali(int a, int b) { return a * b; }\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"Hasil Kali: \" + kali(6, 7));\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Hasil Kali: 42</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Method Challenge</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_methods_param": {
        "title": "Java Method Parameters",
        "summary": "Meneruskan data ke dalam method melalui parameter argumen dan mengembalikan nilai dengan kata kunci `return`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Meneruskan data ke dalam method melalui parameter argumen dan mengembalikan nilai dengan kata kunci `return`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Method Parameters:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Method Parameters",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Method Parameters - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    static String sambut(String nama) {\n        return \"Selamat Belajar, \" + nama + \"!\";\n    }\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(sambut(\"Faisal\"));\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Selamat Belajar, Faisal!</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Method Parameters</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_methods_overloading": {
        "title": "Java Method Overloading",
        "summary": "Mendefinisikan beberapa method dengan nama yang sama selama daftar tipe/jumlah parameternya berbeda.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Mendefinisikan beberapa method dengan nama yang sama selama daftar tipe/jumlah parameternya berbeda.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Method Overloading:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Method Overloading",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Method Overloading - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    static int tambah(int a, int b) { return a + b; }\n    static double tambah(double a, double b) { return a + b; }\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(tambah(5, 10));\n        System.out.println(tambah(4.5, 3.2));\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">15\n7.7</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Method Overloading</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_scope": {
        "title": "Java Scope",
        "summary": "Cakupan visibilitas variabel: Block Scope (di dalam kurung kurawal) dan Method Scope.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Cakupan visibilitas variabel: Block Scope (di dalam kurung kurawal) dan Method Scope.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Scope:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Scope",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Scope - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int x = 100; // Scope lokal main\n        System.out.println(\"Nilai x: \" + x);\n    }\n}\n 