  Rekening r = new Rekening();\n        r.setor(150000);\n        System.out.println(\"Saldo Akhir: Rp \" + r.saldo);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Saldo Akhir: Rp 650000</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
