obil(\"Toyota\");\n        System.out.println(\"Merk Mobil: \" + m.merk);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Merk Mobil: Toyota</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Constructors</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
