 \"Jeruk\"));\n        buah.sort(Comparator.naturalOrder());\n        System.out.println(\"Urut Abjad: \" + buah);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Urut Abjad: [Apel, Jeruk, Mangga]</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
