        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Menulis kode yang aman terhadap tipe data (Type-Safety) menggunakan parameter tipe generik `<T>` pada class dan method.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Generics:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Generics",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Generics - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\nclass Kotak<T> {\n    private T isi;\n    public void set(T i) { this.isi = i; }\n    public T get() { return isi; }\n}\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Kotak<String> k = new Kotak<>();\n        k.set(\"Tersimpan Aman\");\n        System.out.println(k.get());\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Tersimpan Aman</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Generics</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_annotations": {
        "title": "Java Annotations",
        "summary": "Metadata penjelas kode seperti `@Override`, `@Deprecated`, `@SuppressWarnings`, dan anotasi kustom.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Metadata penjelas kode seperti `@Override`, `@Deprecated`, `@SuppressWarnings`, dan anotasi kustom.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Annotations:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Annotations",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Annotations - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\npublic class Main {\n    @Override\n    public String toString() { return \"Objek Main Teranotasi\"; }\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(new Main());\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Objek Main Teranotasi</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Annotations</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_regex": {
        "title": "Java RegEx",
        "summary": "Pencocokan ekspresi reguler menggunakan kelas `java.util.regex.Pattern` dan `Matcher`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Pencocokan ekspresi reguler menggunakan kelas `java.util.regex.Pattern` dan `Matcher`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java RegEx:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java RegEx",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java RegEx - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\nimport java.util.regex.*;\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Pattern p = Pattern.compile(\"\\\\d+\");\n        Matcher m = p.matcher(\"Order #2026 Sukses\");\n        if(m.find()) System.out.println(\"Nomor Order: \" + m.group());\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Nomor Order: 2026</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java RegEx</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_threads": {
        "title": "Java Threads",
        "summary": "Pemrograman multithreading: mempercepat eksekusi konkuren dengan mewarisi kelas `Thread` atau mengimplementasikan `Runnable`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Pemrograman multithreading: mempercepat eksekusi konkuren dengan mewarisi kelas `Thread` atau mengimplementasikan `Runnable`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Threads:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Threads",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Threads - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\nclass MyThread extends Thread {\n    public void run() { System.out.println(\"Thread Terpisah Berjalan!\"); }\n}\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new MyThread().start();\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Thread Terpisah Berjalan!</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Threads</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_lambda": {
        "title": "Java Lambda",
        "summary": "Ekspresi fungsi ringkas gaya fungsional `(parameter) -> ekspresi` pada antarmuka fungsional (Functional Interfaces).",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Ekspresi fungsi ringkas gaya fungsional `(parameter) -> ekspresi` pada antarmuka fungsional (Functional Interfaces).</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Lambda:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Lambda",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Lambda - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\nimport java.util.List;\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List.of(\"Java\", \"Kotlin\", \"Scala\").forEach(b -> System.out.println(\"Bahasa: \" + b));\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Bahasa: Java\nBahasa: Kotlin\nBahasa: Scala</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Lambda</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_optional": {
        "title": "Java Optional",
        "summary": "Wadah objek `java.util.Optional<T>` untuk mencegah crash akibat `NullPointerException` secara elegan.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Wadah objek `java.util.Optional<T>` untuk mencegah crash akibat `NullPointerException` secara elegan.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Optional:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Optional",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Optional - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\nimport java.util.Optional;\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Optional<String> nama = Optional.ofNullable(null);\n        System.out.println(\"Nilai: \" + nama.orElse(\"Tamu Anonim\"));\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Nilai: Tamu Anonim</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Optional</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      },
      "java_advanced_sorting": {
        "title": "Java Advanced Sorting",
        "summary": "Pengurutan tingkat lanjut multi-kriteria menggunakan ekspresi lambda `Comparator.comparing()`.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Pengurutan tingkat lanjut multi-kriteria menggunakan ekspresi lambda `Comparator.comparing()`.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-4 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-brands fa-java text-danger me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Java Advanced Sorting:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        Pelajari arsitektur sintaks Java di bawah, perhatikan aturan kompilasi JVM yang ketat (Strongly-Typed), dan uji secara langsung di Code Lab Skillance Academy.\n    </p>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Contoh Kode Java: Java Advanced Sorting",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Fira Code', Consolas, Monaco, monospace;\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            padding: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .header {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n        .dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n        .dot-red { background: #ef4444; }\n        .dot-yellow { background: #eab308; }\n        .dot-green { background: #22c55e; }\n        .code-box {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-bottom: 1px dashed #334155;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            white-space: pre-wrap;\n        }\n        .comment { color: #64748b; font-style: italic; }\n        .output-box {\n            background: #020617;\n            padding: 18px 20px;\n            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;\n            color: #e2e8f0;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <span class=\"dot dot-red\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-yellow\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot dot-green\"></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #ea580c;\">☕ Java Advanced Sorting - Skillance Java 21</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"code-box\">\n<span class=\"comment\">// Skrip Java 21 - Skillance Academy Indonesia</span>\nimport java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        List<String> list = Arrays.asList(\"Pisang\", \"Apel\", \"Semangka\");\n        list.sort(Comparator.comparingInt(String::length));\n        System.out.println(\"Urut Berdasarkan Panjang Kata: \" + list);\n    }\n}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"output-box\">\n        <div style=\"color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 6px;\">[JVM Terminal Output] &gt; javac Main.java &amp;&amp; java Main</div>\n        <div style=\"color: #4ade80; font-weight: bold;\">Urut Berdasarkan Panjang Kata: [Apel, Pisang, Semangka]</div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<p>Uji skrip Java untuk topik <strong>Java Advanced Sorting</strong> di atas dan amati hasil kompilasi terminal JVM secara instan.</p>"
      }
    },
    "Java Projects": {
      "java_projects": {
        "title": "Java Projects",
        "summary": "Kumpulan studi kasus proyek akhir: Sistem Kasir POS (Point of Sales), Manajemen Perpustakaan, dan REST API Backend Spring Boot.",
